            "text": "未必 means not necessarily. It questions certainty; it does not confidently assert the opposite proposition.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他未必会来。",
                "pinyin": "tā wèibì huì lái 。",
                "meaning": "He will not necessarily come.",
